:"2024-12-06T18:40:44Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2485707846,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6UKORG","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_99504.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18042884/test_pr_99504.zip)\r\n\r\nSome excerpts from my music library, so you can see the kind of tags that can be returned (mostly Ogg Vorbis because I don't have a lot of WAVs at hand):\r\n\r\n```json\r\n// Note: `date` does not have a standard ordering or format.\r\n\r\nOGG: d_e1m7.ogg\r\n{ \"comment\": \"E1M7\", \"title\": \"Demons On The Prey\", \"artist\": \"Robert Prince\", \"loop_start\": \"297731\", \"loop_end\": \"6833642\", \"composer\": \"Robert Prince\", \"album\": \"Doom\", \"date\": \"1993\", \"tracknumber\": \"8\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: Aerial - Miss Understand .ogg\r\n{ \"artist\": \"Aerial\", \"album\": \"In The End\", \"jamendo-track-id\": \"530364\", \"tracknumber\": \"07\", \"title\": \"Miss Understand \", \"organization\": \"http://www.jamendo.com\", \"comment\": \"http://www.jamendo.com\", \"publisher\": \"http://www.jamendo.com\", \"description\": \"http://www.jamendo.com\", \"www\": \"http://www.jamendo.comalbum/61894/\", \"license\": \"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\", \"copyright\": \"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\", \"encoded-by\": \"http://www.jamendo.com\", \"wcop\": \"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\", \"woaf\": \"http://www.jamendo.com/en/track/530364\", \"date\": \"2010-02-23\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: quake_2.ogg\r\n{ \"language\": \"eng\", \"encoder\": \"Lavf56.40.101\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: RE.ogg\r\n{ \"encoder\": \"FL Studio\", \"title\": \"\", \"genre\": \"\", \"artist\": \"\", \"comment\": \"\", \"contact\": \"\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: postmatch_7.ogg\r\n{ \"website\": \"http://www.warsow.net/\", \"album\": \"Warsow Postmatch Music\", \"date\": \"2006\", \"albumartistsort\": \"Warsow\", \"artist\": \"David Regaldi\", \"title\": \"Postmatch #7\", \"totaltracks\": \"7\", \"albumartist\": \"Warsow\", \"musicip_puid\": \"7a1d5a7c-9ce3-908c-5102-768fd82c89fe\", \"composer\": \"David Regaldi\", \"genre\": \"Electronic\", \"tracknumber\": \"7\", \"artistsort\": \"Regaldi, David\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: zzzzz.ogg\r\n{ \"title\": \"zzzz\", \"artist\": \"chooksta\", \"comment\": \"me plumber\", \"replaygain_track_peak\": \"1.17353797\", \"replaygain_track_gain\": \"-7.42 dB\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: rising-of-the-phoenix.ogg\r\n{ \"cool\": \"This song has been made using Linux MultiMedia Studio\", \"loop_start\": \"1638621\", \"loop_end\": \"7001379\", \"author\": \"master[mind]\", \"title\": \"Rising of the Phoenix\", \"replaygain_track_peak\": \"1.29515612\", \"replaygain_track_gain\": \"-0.57 dB\", \"artist\": \"master[mind]\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: 10-paniq-rattengift_instrumental_mix.ogg\r\n{ \"encoder\": \"Lavf55.45.100\", \"artist\": \"paniq\", \"title\": \"Rattengift (Instrumental Mix)\", \"tracknumber\": \"10\", \"album\": \"Achillesverse\", \"format\": \"VBR MP3\", \"mtime\": \"1253197885\", \"size\": \"5809280\", \"md5\": \"6719a338746f0bc158cef1a5c6fd067e\", \"crc32\": \"d8fae47c\", \"sha1\": \"fdc6352cb44ea00d6e284a3b7528c91f44e745cb\", \"length\": \"242.05\", \"height\": \"0\", \"width\": \"0\", \"source\": \"original\", \"comment\": \"http://archive.org/details/Achillesverse\" }\r\n\r\nOGG: zero-project - 01 - The crossroads of change.ogg\r\n{ \"title\": \"The crossroads of change\", \"artist\": \"zero-project\", \"album\": \"Metamorphosis\", \"date\": \"2015\", \"genre\": \"New Age\", \"comment\": \"www.zero-project.gr\", \"composer\": \"zero-project\", \"originalartist\": \"zero-project\", \"copyright\": \"zero-project\", \"url\": \"www.zero-project.gr\", \"encodedby\": \"Audacity 2.0.6\", \"tracknumber\": \"01\", \"bpm\": \"110\", \"origartist\": \"zero-project\", \"album artist\": \"zero-project\", \"coverartmime\": \"image/jpeg\", \"coverart\": \"/9j/4R4vRXhpZgAATU0AKgAAAAgADAEAAAMAAAABBYkAAAEBAAMAAAABBYkAAAEC...DbX/2Q==\", \"publisher\": \"zero-project\" }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Some odd cases\r\n\r\n#### Keys are not sorted\r\n\r\nKeys are not sorted in the dictionary, which means they'll appear in a different order in different files. Is this an issue? If we decide to sort them, it should be done at load-time.\r\n\r\n#### Empty tag\r\n\r\nAn empty tag is included at the end of some WAV files:\r\n\r\n```\r\nWAV: Jung.wav\r\n{ \"date\": \"2000-03-26\", \"\": \"\" }\r\n```\r\n\r\n[Jung.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18042463/Jung.zip)\r\n\r\nShould we exclude it automatically?\r\n\r\n#### Only one tag available in Godot\r\n\r\nNo tags can be read other than the artist, and a warning is printed when the WAV is loaded:\r\n\r\n```\r\nWARNING: Reading less data than requested\r\n     at: get_buffer (./core/io/file_access_memory.cpp:133)\r\n\r\nWAV: 01 - Title Theme (Main Menu)\r\n{ \"artist\": \"David Wise\", \"\": \"\" }\r\n```\r\n\r\n[01 - Title Theme (Main Menu).zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18042497/01.-.Title.Theme.Main.Menu.zip)\r\n\r\nDolphin can read all the tags successfully, including an embedded cover:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f65493b-c16a-48b1-b387-1f170265e21a)\r\n\r\n(Godot is able to play back that file successfully when loaded at runtime.)\r\n\r\n#### Files failing to load\r\n\r\nThis file fails to load in Godot, but other apps can play them back successfully.\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Not a WAV file. File should start with 'RIFF', but found 'ID3', in file of size 7057536 bytes\r\n   at: load_from_buffer (./scene/resources/audio_stream_wav.cpp:802)\r\n\r\nWAV: inter.wav\r\n```\r\n\r\n[inter.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18042539/inter.zip)\r\n\r\nInterestingly, \"ID3\" is the name of a metadata standard. Does that mean metadata is put before the RIFF file header in some WAV files?","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99504#pullrequestreview-2485707846","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99504","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99504#pullrequestreview-2485707846"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99504"}},"submitted_at":"2024-12-06T19:33:49Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2486427327,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6UM96_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.